flowchart TD
  A[1. Group candidate stations] --> D{2. Candidate available in this cell?}
  D -- Yes --> E[2a. Prepare hourly observations]
  D -- No --> U[Leave cell unrepresented]
  subgraph cell[2. Assess candidates within each cell]
    E --> F{2b. Find a qualifying year: coverage passes?}
    F -- No --> J{Earlier endpoint available?}
    J -- Yes: move back one day --> F
    J -- No qualifying window --> D
    F -- Yes --> G{2c. Check station consistency: pass?}
    G -- No: next candidate --> D
    G -- Yes --> H[Accept station]
  end
  U --> N[Finish cell]
  H --> N
  N -- More cells --> D
  N -- All cells assessed --> O[3. Summarize errors]
